Title: Wrong Wedding (genre test, written for this repo)

EPISODE 1

INT. BANQUET HALL - DAY

A huge wedding. ROHAN, in a borrowed sherwani, rushes in late, holding a gift.

ROHAN
(to himself)
Gate number two, Sharma wedding. Easy.

He hugs the first uncle he sees.

ROHAN
Uncle ji! Congratulations! Your daughter looks beautiful.

UNCLE
(confused)
Beta, this is my son's wedding.

ROHAN
(without missing a beat)
And your son also looks beautiful.

The uncle laughs. Rohan escapes to the buffet.

AUNTY
(suspicious)
You're from the bride's side or the groom's side?

ROHAN
(confident)
Both. I'm very neutral.

AUNTY
(narrowing her eyes)
Then you'll know the bride's name.

Rohan freezes. He reads the flower board behind her, upside down.

ROHAN
Of course. It's... Welcome.

AUNTY
(shouting)
Security! There's a Welcome guest here!

The DJ stops the music. Two hundred guests turn to look at him.

The bride lifts her veil. It's PRIYA, Rohan's ex.

PRIYA
(stunned)
Rohan? What are you doing at my wedding?
